msgstr "他们屏幕的照片，收到后显示"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1621
msgid "Lift ban…"
msgstr "解除封禁…"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1623
msgid "Lift — remove this ban from the list"
msgstr "解除 — 从列表中移除该封禁"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1624
#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1635
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Lift the ban on {player}"
msgstr "解除对 {player} 的封禁"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1625
msgid "the ban is removed from the list"
msgstr "封禁将从列表中移除"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1626
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"<b>{player} may rejoin the servers this ban covers.</b> The ban is "
"removed from the ban list and expires now."
msgstr "<b>{player} 可以重新加入此封禁覆盖的服务器。</b>该封禁将从列表中移除并立即失效。"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1628
msgid ""
"<b>This lift applies here only.</b> The DGSA cloud ban is not affected by"
" it."
msgstr "<b>此解除仅在本站生效。</b>DGSA 云端封禁不受影响。"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1630
msgid ""
"The ban expires on the servers it covers here. A player who is online "
"right now is not disconnected by the lift."
msgstr "该封禁在本地覆盖的服务器上立即失效。当前在线的玩家不会因解除而被断开。"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1632
msgid "Only this installation's copy is lifted: the global DGSA ban is untouched."
msgstr "仅解除本站的副本：全局 DGSA 封禁保持不变。"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1634
msgid "Lift ban"
msgstr "解除封禁"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1643
msgid "Add ban…"
msgstr "添加封禁…"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1647
msgid "Add a ban to the list"
msgstr "将封禁添加到列表"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1648
#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:6398
msgid "Add a ban"
msgstr "添加封禁"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1649
msgid "the ban is written to the list every installation syncs"
msgstr "封禁会写入每个安装都会同步的列表"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1650
msgid ""
"<b>The player is removed from the servers this ban covers and cannot "
"rejoin them</b> for as long as the ban stands. Empty duration means it "
"never expires on its own."
msgstr "<b>该玩家会被移出此封禁覆盖的服务器，并且在封禁有效期间无法重新加入</b>。时长留空表示永不自动过期。"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1653
msgid ""
"The ban is written to the ban list every installation syncs, so it holds "
"wherever they connect from — not only on one server."
msgstr "该封禁会写入每个安装都会同步的封禁列表，因此在任何服务器连接都有效 — 不只在一个服务器上。"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1656
msgid "Add the ban — an empty duration is permanent"
msgstr "添加封禁 — 时长留空即为永久"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1669
msgid "Edit…"
msgstr "编辑…"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1672
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Edit the reason or the expiration of the ban on {player}"
msgstr "编辑对 {player} 封禁的原因或到期时间"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1673
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Edit the ban on {player}"
msgstr "编辑对 {player} 的封禁"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1674
msgid "only the reason and the expiration can change"
msgstr "仅原因和到期时间会改变"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1675
msgid ""
"Only the reason and the expiration can change. The player, the UCID and "
"the scope stay: a different player is a different ban, and a ban that "
"covers other servers is lifted and re-added instead of moved."
msgstr "只有原因和到期时间可以更改。玩家、UCID 和范围保持不变：不同的玩家就是不同的封禁，而覆盖其他服务器的封禁会先解除再重新添加，而不是移动。"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1678
msgid "Save ban"
msgstr "保存封禁"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1679
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Save the ban on {player}"
msgstr "保存对 {player} 的封禁"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1776
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Restart node — every server on {node} goes down while the node restarts"
msgstr "重启节点 — 节点重启期间 {node} 上的每台服务器都会下线"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1777
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Restart node {node}"
msgstr "重启节点 {node}"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1778
msgid "every server on the node goes down"
msgstr "节点上的每台服务器都会下线"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1779
#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1811
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"<b>Every server on {node} goes down with it</b> — {servers} server(s) and"
" {players} player(s) are on it right now."
msgstr "<b>{node} 上的每台服务器都会随之下线</b> — 目前上面有 {servers} 台服务器和 {players} 名玩家。"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1781
msgid ""
"A node restart ends the bot process on that machine; the launcher there "
"brings the node back, and its servers do not: they stay down until "
"somebody starts them again."
msgstr "重启节点会结束该机器上的机器人进程；那里的启动器会把节点带回来，但它的服务器不会：它们保持下线，直到有人重新启动它们。"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1784
msgid ""
"<b>This console runs inside that node</b> — restarting it ends the "
"process serving this page, and this window has to be reloaded once the "
"node is back."
msgstr "<b>此控制台运行在该节点内</b> — 重启它会结束服务此页面的进程，节点恢复后需要重新加载此窗口。"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1787
msgid "Restart node"
msgstr "重启节点"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1788
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Restart {node} — every server on it goes down"
msgstr "重启 {node} — 其上的每台服务器都会下线"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1791
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Shut down node — every server on {node} goes down and nothing brings it "
"back"
msgstr "关闭节点 — {node} 上的每台服务器都会下线，且没有任何东西能把它带回来"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1792
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Shut down node {node}"
msgstr "关闭节点 {node}"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1793
msgid "every server on the node goes down, for good"
msgstr "节点上的每台服务器都会永久下线"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1794
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"<b>{servers} server(s) on {node} go down and {players} player(s) are "
"disconnected, and nothing brings the node back.</b>"
msgstr "<b>{node} 上的 {servers} 台服务器将下线，{players} 名玩家将被断开，且没有任何东西能把节点带回来。</b>"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1796
msgid ""
"A node shutdown ends the bot process on that machine for good: somebody "
"has to start the node THERE, at the machine. A node that is down cannot "
"be started from this browser, and its servers stay down with it."
msgstr "关闭节点会永久结束该机器上的机器人进程：必须有人在那台机器那里启动节点。已下线的节点无法从此浏览器启动，它的服务器也会随之保持下线。"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1800
msgid ""
"<b>This console runs inside that node</b> — shutting it down ends the "
"process serving this page, and nothing brings it back until somebody "
"starts the node on that machine."
msgstr "<b>此控制台运行在该节点内</b> — 关闭它会结束服务此页面的进程，在有人在那台机器上启动节点之前，没有任何东西能把它带回来。"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1803
msgid "Shut down node"
msgstr "关闭节点"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1804
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Shut down {node} — every server on it goes down"
msgstr "关闭 {node} — 其上的每台服务器都会下线"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1806
msgid "Upgrade"
msgstr "升级"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1807
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Upgrade node — update DCSServerBot on {node} and restart it; every server"
" on it goes down"
msgstr "升级节点 — 更新 {node} 上的 DCSServerBot 并重启它；其上的每台服务器都会下线"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1809
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Upgrade node {node}"
msgstr "升级节点 {node}"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1810
msgid "update and restart, every server goes down"
msgstr "更新并重启，每台服务器都会下线"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1813
msgid ""
"The node is updated and restarted. The console offers Upgrade ONLY while "
"the node itself reports an update pending — it asks every node in the "
"background, never while rendering a page, and this control is gone again "
"once there is nothing to upgrade."
msgstr ""
"节点会被更新并重启。只有当节点自身报告有更新待处理时，控制台才会提供“升级” — "
"它在后台询问每个节点，从不在渲染页面时询问，一旦没有可升级的内容，此控件又会消失。"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1817
msgid ""
"<b>This console runs inside that node</b> — upgrading it ends the process"
" serving this page, and this window has to be reloaded once the node is "
"back."
msgstr "<b>此控制台运行在该节点内</b> — 升级它会结束服务此页面的进程，节点恢复后需要重新加载此窗口。"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1820
msgid "Upgrade node"
msgstr "升级节点"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1821
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Upgrade {node} — every server on it goes down"
msgstr "升级 {node} — 其上的每台服务器都会下线"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1836
#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1860
msgid "Take servers offline"
msgstr "让服务器下线"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1839
msgid "Also mark them as maintenance"
msgstr "同时将它们标记为维护"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1841
msgid ""
"On by default: without it a scheduled start can bring the servers back "
"while the node is \"offline\"."
msgstr "默认开启：不勾选的话，计划启动可能会在节点“离线”期间把服务器重新拉起。"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1843
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Take the servers on {node} offline?"
msgstr "让 {node} 上的服务器下线？"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1844
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Take servers offline — every server on {node} that is up is marked as "
"maintenance and stopped; its players are disconnected, while the node's "
"services stay up"
msgstr "让服务器下线 — {node} 上每一台正在运行的服务器都会被标记为维护并停止；其玩家会被断开，而节点的服务保持不变"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1847
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Take the servers on {node} out of service"
msgstr "让 {node} 上的服务器停止服务"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1848
msgid "marks the node's servers as maintenance and stops them"
msgstr "将节点的服务器标记为维护并停止它们"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1849
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"<b>{servers} server(s) on {node} go down and {players} player(s) are "
"disconnected.</b> The box below is ticked by default and marks those "
"servers as maintenance — leave it ticked unless you mean to let a "
"scheduled start bring them back while the node is \"offline\"."
msgstr ""
"<b>{node} 上的 {servers} 台服务器将下线，{players} "
"名玩家将被断开。</b>下方复选框默认勾选，会把这些服务器标记为维护 — 除非你想让计划启动在节点“离线”期间把它们带回来，否则请保持勾选。"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1853
msgid ""
"Only the SERVERS on the node change. The node itself keeps running, so "
"its services — including this console — stay up, and bringing the node "
"back is a job this browser CAN do. With the box ticked the servers are "
"flagged as maintenance before they stop, so they stay out of service "
"until somebody ends that; clear the box and no flag is written at all — "
"the servers stop and nothing keeps the scheduler from starting them "
"again."
msgstr ""
"改变的只有该节点上的服务器。节点本身继续运行，因此它的服务 — 包括此控制台 — "
"保持在线，把节点带回来是此浏览器可以完成的工作。勾选复选框后，服务器在停止前会被标记为维护，因此它们会保持停止服务，直到有人结束该状态；取消勾选则不写入任何标记"
" — 服务器会停止，且没有任何东西阻止调度器再次启动它们。"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1861
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Take {node} offline — {servers} server(s) go down, {players} player(s) "
"are disconnected"
msgstr "让 {node} 下线 — {servers} 台服务器将下线，{players} 名玩家将被断开"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1869
#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1887
msgid "Bring servers online"
msgstr "让服务器上线"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1871
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Bring the servers on {node} back online?"
msgstr "让 {node} 上的服务器重新上线？"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1872
msgid ""
"Bring servers online — clear the maintenance flags this node's power-off "
"set; the scheduler then starts the servers it stopped. A flag set by hand"
" is left alone"
msgstr "让服务器上线 — 清除该节点下线时设置的维护标记，并启动它停止的服务器；手动设置的标记则保持不动"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1875
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Bring the servers on {node} back into service"
msgstr "让 {node} 上的服务器恢复服务"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1876
msgid ""
"ends the maintenance this node's power-off set — the scheduler starts "
"what it stopped"
msgstr "结束该节点下线时设置的维护，并启动它停止的服务器"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1879
msgid ""
"This reverts EXACTLY the last power-off on this node: it clears only the "
"maintenance flags that operation set, and the servers it stopped are left"
" for the scheduler to start. A flag somebody set by hand is never "
"cleared, and a server that is still in maintenance is not started. If the"
" bot has restarted since the power-off the record is gone, and this then "
"releases every server that is down and not in maintenance, clearing no "
"flag at all — the message says which of the two happened. The node's "
"services were never touched."
msgstr ""
"此操作会精确地撤销该节点上一次的下线：它只清除该操作设置的维护标记，并且只启动它停止的服务器。有人手动设置的标记绝不会被清除，仍处于维护的服务器绝不会被启动。如果自那次下线以来机器人已经重启，记录就没了，此时它会启动每一台处于下线且不在维护的服务器，且不清除任何标记"
" — 消息会说明发生的是这两种情况中的哪一种。节点的服务从未被触碰。"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1888
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Bring {node} online — the flags its power-off set are cleared, and the "
"scheduler starts what it stopped"
msgstr "让 {node} 上线 — 清除其下线时设置的标记，启动它停止的服务器"

