#: services/webservice/pages/settings.py:291
msgid ""
"Pick a node to configure. The tabs then show only its own block and its "
"instances — never every node at once."
msgstr "选择一个节点进行配置。选项卡随后只显示该节点自身的配置块及其实例——绝不会一次显示所有节点。"

#: services/webservice/pages/settings.py:296
msgid ""
"Expert Mode edits only this node's part of the file — every other node is"
" left untouched."
msgstr "专家模式只编辑该节点在文件中的部分——其他所有节点保持不变。"

#: services/webservice/pages/settings.py:299
msgid ""
"<b>DEFAULT</b> is the scope every instance starts from. A block under it "
"changes only that node or instance — and because the scope is the TAB, no"
" field carries a <code>default.</code> prefix."
msgstr ""
"<b>DEFAULT</b> 是每个实例起始的范围。其下的区块只更改该节点或该实例——由于范围就是标签页，任何字段都不带 "
"<code>default.</code> 前缀。"

#: services/webservice/pages/settings.py:302
#, python-format
msgid ""
"This block changes only <b>%(scope)s</b>. It INHERITS everything it does "
"not set from DEFAULT — nothing is copied, so a field left unset keeps "
"following the default block."
msgstr "此区块只更改 <b>%(scope)s</b>。未设置的内容均从 DEFAULT 继承——不会复制任何内容，因此未设置的字段仍沿用默认区块。"

#: services/webservice/pages/settings.py:309
msgid ""
"This configuration has no node or instance blocks — the whole file is one"
" scope, so no field carries a <code>DEFAULT.</code> prefix."
msgstr "此配置没有节点或实例块——整个文件就是一个范围，因此任何字段都不带 <code>DEFAULT.</code> 前缀。"

