msgstr "调度器配置中没有针对此服务器的内容，因此没有为它计划任何事项。"

#: services/webservice/pages/server_detail.py:190
msgid "The scheduler plugin could not answer for this server, so there is no plan to show here. The file itself is still readable and editable in Settings."
msgstr "调度器插件无法为此服务器给出答案，因此这里没有可显示的计划。该文件仍可在设置中读取和编辑。"

#: services/webservice/pages/server_detail.py:193
