msgstr "返回计划"

#: services/webservice/templates/scheduler_body.html:86
msgid "Every time in this block is read in this zone. Empty means the machine's own local time, which is what the bot assumes when the key is absent."
msgstr "此块中的每个时间都按此时区读取。留空表示机器自身的本地时间，这也是键缺失时机器人所采用的时间。"

#: services/webservice/templates/scheduler_body.html:91
msgid "The week"
msgstr "一周"

#: services/webservice/templates/scheduler_body.html:113
