msgstr "不重新加载正在运行的任务"

#: services/webservice/templates/scheduler_body.html
msgid "Add an entry"
msgstr "添加条目"

#: services/webservice/templates/scheduler_body.html
msgid "Remove entry %(number)s"
msgstr "删除条目 %(number)s"

#: services/webservice/templates/scheduler_body.html
msgid "This server's plan schedules no actions yet."
msgstr "此服务器的计划尚未安排任何操作。"

#: services/webservice/scheduler_plan.py
msgid "Nothing happens for this entry until a trigger is stated: times of day, a cron expression, minutes of mission time, minutes of server runtime, or minutes with nobody on the server."
msgstr "在设置触发器之前，此条目不会执行任何操作：每天的时间、cron 表达式、任务时间分钟数、服务器运行分钟数或无人在线的分钟数。"

#: services/webservice/scheduler_plan.py
msgid "A removal must name an entry by its position number, so nothing was removed."
msgstr "删除必须按位置编号指定条目，因此未删除任何内容。"

#: services/webservice/scheduler_plan.py
msgid "This plan has no entry at that position, so nothing was removed."
msgstr "此计划在该位置没有条目，因此未删除任何内容。"

#: services/webservice/templates/scheduler_body.html:179
msgid "The warning message"
msgstr "警告消息"

#: services/webservice/templates/scheduler_body.html:196
msgid "Seconds"
msgstr "秒"

#: services/webservice/templates/scheduler_body.html:203
msgid "The ladder"
msgstr "阶梯"

#: services/webservice/templates/scheduler_body.html:271
msgid "This step writes nothing"
msgstr "此步骤不写入任何内容"

#: services/webservice/templates/scheduler_body.html:273
msgid "Every value on these steps travels in the address, so a refresh keeps it and the page works with JavaScript off."
msgstr "这些步骤中的每个值都保存在地址中，因此刷新不会丢失，页面在关闭 JavaScript 时也能正常工作。"

#: services/webservice/templates/scheduler_body.html:274
msgid "The review step and the save follow in the wizard's last step."
msgstr "检查与保存位于向导的最后一步。"

#: services/webservice/templates/scheduler_body.html:292
msgid "Change the plan"
msgstr "修改计划"

#: services/webservice/scheduler_plan.py:965
msgid ""
"The startup delay is one value shared by every server, so this tab does "
"not write it. Nothing was written."
msgstr "启动延迟是所有服务器共用的值，因此此选项卡不会写入它。未写入任何内容。"

#: services/webservice/scheduler_plan.py:967
msgid ""
"local_times and utc_times are deprecated; this tab refuses to write "
"either of them. Nothing was written."
msgstr "local_times 和 utc_times 已弃用；此选项卡拒绝写入其中任何一个。未写入任何内容。"

#: services/webservice/scheduler_plan.py:969
msgid ""
"That request names a value this tab does not write, so nothing was "
"written."
msgstr "该请求指定了此选项卡不会写入的值，因此未写入任何内容。"

#: services/webservice/pages/server_detail.py:177
msgid "Review & save"
msgstr "检查并保存"

#: services/webservice/pages/server_detail.py:178
msgid "the block and the write"
msgstr "配置块与写入"

#: services/webservice/pages/settings.py:484
msgid "No server was named for this save, so nothing was written."
msgstr "本次保存未指定服务器，因此未写入任何内容。"

#: services/webservice/pages/settings.py:486
msgid ""
"DEFAULT, commands and chat_commands are not server blocks — they are "
"edited in Settings, so nothing was written."
msgstr "DEFAULT、commands 和 chat_commands 不是服务器配置块——它们在设置中编辑，因此未写入任何内容。"

#: services/webservice/pages/settings.py:489
msgid "That name is not a server this console can edit, so nothing was written."
msgstr "该名称不是此控制台可编辑的服务器，因此未写入任何内容。"

#: services/webservice/pages/settings.py:491
msgid "That name is a node, not a server, so nothing was written."
msgstr "该名称是节点而非服务器，因此未写入任何内容。"

#: services/webservice/pages/settings.py:562
msgid "Expert Mode is available to an Admin only, so nothing was written. Use the plan's steps instead."
msgstr "专家模式仅限管理员使用，因此未写入任何内容。请改用计划的各个步骤。"

#: services/webservice/templates/scheduler_body.html:46
msgid "Review, then save"
msgstr "先检查，再保存"

#: services/webservice/templates/scheduler_body.html:48
msgid ""
"This is the block that will be written, and only this block: DEFAULT, "
"every other server's block, the comments and the key order of the file "
"stay as they are."
msgstr "这是将要写入的配置块，且仅此块：DEFAULT、其他所有服务器的配置块、注释以及文件中的键顺序均保持不变。"

#: services/webservice/templates/scheduler_body.html:75
msgid "What changes"
msgstr "更改内容"

#: services/webservice/templates/scheduler_body.html:83
msgid "back to inherited"
msgstr "恢复为继承"

#: services/webservice/templates/scheduler_body.html:87
msgid ""
"This plan needs no change to the server's own block: every value it "
"states is the inherited one. Saving writes nothing."
msgstr "此计划无需更改服务器自身的配置块：其中每个值都是继承值。保存不会写入任何内容。"

#: services/webservice/templates/scheduler_body.html:94
msgid "What is not touched"
msgstr "未改动的内容"

#: services/webservice/templates/scheduler_body.html:97
msgid "the shared block — edit it in Settings"
msgstr "共享配置块——在设置中编辑"

#: services/webservice/templates/scheduler_body.html:98
msgid "Other servers"
msgstr "其他服务器"

#: services/webservice/templates/scheduler_body.html:98
msgid "their blocks, byte-identical"
msgstr "它们的配置块，字节完全一致"

#: services/webservice/templates/scheduler_body.html:99
msgid "Comments and order"
msgstr "注释与顺序"

#: services/webservice/templates/scheduler_body.html:99
msgid "kept by the writer's round-trip"
msgstr "由写入器的往返转换保留"

#: services/webservice/templates/scheduler_body.html:100
msgid "a shared value this tab never writes"
msgstr "此选项卡从不写入的共享值"

#: services/webservice/templates/scheduler_body.html:105
msgid "Saving"
msgstr "保存"

#: services/webservice/templates/scheduler_body.html:107
msgid ""
"The block is validated against the scheduler's own schema before it is "
"written. A file that does not validate is refused and nothing is written;"
" a .bak is kept."
msgstr "写入前会依据调度器自身的模式校验该配置块。未通过校验的文件将被拒绝，不写入任何内容；并保留 .bak。"

#: services/webservice/templates/scheduler_body.html:108
msgid ""
"The bot keeps the plan in memory, so the change applies after a reload of"
" the scheduler plugin."
msgstr "机器人在内存中保留该计划，因此在重新加载调度器插件后生效。"

#: services/webservice/templates/scheduler_body.html:116
msgid "Save this server's block"
msgstr "保存此服务器的配置块"

#: services/webservice/templates/scheduler_body.html:120
msgid "Discard"
msgstr "放弃"

#: services/webservice/templates/scheduler_body.html:121
msgid "Save the schedule"
msgstr "保存计划"

#: services/webservice/templates/scheduler_body.html:187
msgid "the machine's own local time"
msgstr "机器自身的本地时间"

#: services/webservice/templates/scheduler_body.html:204
msgid "From"
msgstr "从"

#: services/webservice/templates/scheduler_body.html:207
msgid "To"
msgstr "到"

#: services/webservice/templates/scheduler_body.html:213
msgid "Days"
msgstr "星期"

#: services/webservice/templates/scheduler_body.html:216
msgid "Remove row"
msgstr "删除该行"

#: services/webservice/templates/scheduler_body.html:217
msgid "Row"
msgstr "行"

#: services/webservice/scheduler_plan.py:509
msgid "The start must be before the end, or the range covers no time."
msgstr "开始时间必须早于结束时间，否则该时段不覆盖任何时间。"

#: services/webservice/scheduler_plan.py:510
msgid "This range overlaps an earlier row, so the week would be ambiguous."
msgstr "该时段与前面的行重叠，这一周将无法确定。"

#: services/webservice/scheduler_plan.py:511
msgid "The seven days must be seven letters, each Y, N or P."
msgstr "七天必须是七个字母，每个为 Y、N 或 P。"

#: services/webservice/templates/scheduler_body.html:197
msgid "One row per time range, seven letters Monday first: Y must be running, N must be offline, P stays up until the last player leaves. A row without both times is not part of the plan, and the scheduler does not touch the server then."
msgstr "每个时段一行，七个字母，周一在前：Y 必须运行，N 必须关闭，P 保持在线直到最后一名玩家离开。缺少开始或结束时间的行不属于计划，调度器此时不会动服务器。"

#: services/webservice/scheduler_plan.py:504
msgid "The mission list could not be read, so the missions are not offered here. Type the value instead."
msgstr "无法读取任务列表，因此这里不提供任务选择。请直接输入数值。"

#: services/webservice/scheduler_plan.py:506
msgid "The preset files could not be read, so the presets are not offered here. Type the entries instead."
msgstr "无法读取预设文件，因此这里不提供预设选择。请直接输入条目。"

#: services/webservice/scheduler_plan.py:511
msgid "not in these files any more"
msgstr "已不在这些文件中"

#: services/webservice/templates/scheduler_body.html:305
msgid "Tick every mission the schedule may start: the bot picks one of the ticked missions at random each time it starts the server."
msgstr "勾选日程可以启动的每个任务：机器人每次启动服务器会从中随机选择一个。"

#: services/webservice/templates/scheduler_body.html:319
msgid "The path relative to the missions directory, exactly as the bot lists it — never a full path on the server."
msgstr "相对于任务目录的路径，与机器人列出的完全一致——绝不是服务器上的完整路径。"

#: services/webservice/templates/scheduler_body.html:326
msgid "Presets to apply"
msgstr "要应用的预设"

#: services/webservice/templates/scheduler_body.html:341
msgid "One group per preset file: a tick applies that file's preset. The bot applies them in the files' order, not in the order you ticked them, and one entry it cannot resolve drops the whole pick."
msgstr "每个预设文件一组：勾选即应用该文件的预设。机器人按文件的顺序应用，而不是你勾选的顺序；只要有一个条目无法解析，整个选择都会被丢弃。"

#: services/webservice/templates/scheduler_body.html:582
msgid "Shown to every player; the bot fills the three names in."
msgstr "会显示给每位玩家；机器人会把三个名称填进去。"

#: services/webservice/templates/scheduler_body.html:584
msgid "A player reads"
msgstr "玩家看到的文字"

#: services/webservice/templates/scheduler_body.html:604
msgid "The text shown at that moment"
msgstr "那一刻显示的文本"

#: services/webservice/templates/scheduler_body.html:603
msgid "One row per warning: the seconds before the change, and the text shown at that moment. A row with text but no seconds is refused, and two rows cannot share the same seconds."
msgstr "每条警告一行：变更前的秒数，以及那一刻显示的文本。有文本但没有秒数的行会被拒绝，两行不能使用相同的秒数。"

#: services/webservice/scheduler_plan.py:518
msgid "either server or mission, whichever the change touches"
msgstr "服务器或任务，取决于变更影响的是哪个"

#: services/webservice/scheduler_plan.py:519
msgid "what happens: restart, shutdown or rotate"
msgstr "发生了什么：restart、shutdown 或 rotate"

#: services/webservice/scheduler_plan.py:520
msgid "how long is left, such as 10 minutes"
msgstr "还剩多少时间，例如 10 分钟"

#: services/webservice/scheduler_plan.py:524
msgid "server"
msgstr "服务器"

#: services/webservice/scheduler_plan.py:525
msgid "restart"
msgstr "重启"

#: services/webservice/scheduler_plan.py:526
msgid "10 minutes"
msgstr "10 分钟"

#: services/webservice/scheduler_plan.py:531
msgid "A warning time must be a whole number of seconds greater than zero, so this row is not written."
msgstr "警告时间必须是大于零的整数秒数，因此这一行不会被写入。"

#: services/webservice/scheduler_plan.py:533
msgid "Another row already states these seconds, and a ladder holds one text per moment, so this row is not written."
msgstr "另一行已经使用这些秒数，而阶梯每个时刻只能有一个文本，因此这一行不会被写入。"

#: services/webservice/scheduler_plan.py:535
msgid "This row states a text but no seconds, so there is no moment to show it at: state the seconds or clear the row."
msgstr "这一行有文本但没有秒数，没有可以显示它的时刻：请填写秒数或清空这一行。"

#: services/webservice/scheduler_plan.py:541
msgid "The review step writes this ladder as a map: each number of seconds to the text shown at that moment."
msgstr "复核步骤会把这条阶梯写成一个映射：每个秒数对应那一刻显示的文本。"

#: services/webservice/scheduler_plan.py:543
msgid "The review step writes this ladder as a list of seconds, with the shared message at every moment."
msgstr "复核步骤会把这条阶梯写成秒数列表，每个时刻都使用共享的文本。"

#: services/webservice/scheduler_plan.py:544
msgid "This ladder states nothing, so the bot shows no warning before the change."
msgstr "这条阶梯没有任何内容，因此机器人不会在变更前显示警告。"

#: services/webservice/scheduler_plan.py:2076
msgid "That text is not valid YAML, so nothing was written."
msgstr "这段文本不是有效的 YAML，因此没有写入任何内容。"

#: services/webservice/scheduler_plan.py:2078
msgid ""
"A server's block is a set of keys and values, and that text is not "
"one, so nothing was written."
msgstr "服务器区块是一组键和值，而这段文本不是，因此没有写入任何内容。"

#: services/webservice/scheduler_plan.py:2082
msgid ""
"That text states the key '%(key)s', which is not part of a server's "
"own block, so nothing was written."
msgstr "这段文本声明了键 '%(key)s'，它不属于服务器自身的区块，因此没有写入任何内容。"

#: services/webservice/templates/scheduler_body.html:259
msgid "This server's block, as YAML"
msgstr "此服务器的区块（YAML）"

#: services/webservice/templates/scheduler_body.html:263
msgid ""
"The block this save writes for this server and no other: DEFAULT and "
"every other server's block are never part of it, and the comments "
"inside it are kept."
msgstr "此次保存只为这个服务器写入的区块：DEFAULT 和其他任何服务器的区块都不在其中，其中的注释会被保留。"

#: services/webservice/templates/scheduler_body.html:264
msgid ""
"In Expert Mode this text is written instead of the block the plan "
"states, so a key you delete here leaves the file. An edit replaces the "
"block's own comments with what you type."
msgstr "在专家模式下，写入的是这段文本而不是计划所声明的区块，因此在这里删除的键会从文件中移除。编辑会用你输入的内容替换区块自身的注释。"

#: services/webservice/templates/scheduler_body.html:268
msgid "Expert Mode text: this box is the editor when the script is off"
msgstr "专家模式文本：脚本关闭时，此框就是编辑器"

#: services/webservice/templates/scheduler_body.html:271
msgid ""
"This save writes no block of its own for this server: every value it "
"states is the inherited one."
msgstr "此次保存不会为这个服务器写入自己的区块：它声明的每个值都是继承来的。"

#: services/webservice/scheduler_plan.py:641
msgid "Start a fixed mission every time this server starts"
msgstr "每次此服务器启动时都启动一个固定任务"

#: services/webservice/scheduler_plan.py:642
msgid "Left off, the server starts the mission that ran last."
msgstr "不勾选时，服务器启动上次运行过的任务。"

#: services/webservice/scheduler_plan.py:643
msgid "Saving with this off removes the startup keys this server's block states, so the server follows DEFAULT again."
msgstr "在未勾选的情况下保存会删除此服务器块中声明的启动键，服务器将重新遵循 DEFAULT。"

#: services/webservice/scheduler_plan.py:655
msgid "by mission ID"
msgstr "按任务 ID"

#: services/webservice/scheduler_plan.py:656
msgid "by mission file"
msgstr "按任务文件"

#: services/webservice/scheduler_plan.py:658
msgid "A start names its mission one of the two ways, never both: the save removes the value the other key carried."
msgstr "一次启动只用两种方式之一指定任务，从不同时使用：保存时会删除另一个键所携带的值。"

#: services/webservice/pages/server_detail.py:174
msgid "mission, presets"
msgstr "任务、预设"

#: services/webservice/templates/scheduler_body.html:484
msgid "Mission and presets"
msgstr "任务与预设"

#: services/webservice/templates/scheduler_body.html:650
#: services/webservice/templates/scheduler_body.html
msgid "Each command runs when that event happens, in the bot's own vocabulary: load:, lua:, call: or run:. Only the mission start takes a delay, in seconds, before its command runs."
msgstr "每个命令在该事件发生时运行，使用机器人自己的写法：load:、lua:、call: 或 run:。只有任务开始带有延迟（秒），在该命令运行之前生效。"
#: services/webservice/templates/scheduler_body.html:332
msgid "Actions (restart, rotate, etc.)"
msgstr "操作（重启、轮换等）"

#: services/webservice/pages/server_detail.py:175
msgid "one trigger, options by method"
msgstr "一个触发器，选项随方法"

#: services/webservice/scheduler_plan.py:566
msgid "When does this run?"
msgstr "什么时候执行？"

#: services/webservice/scheduler_plan.py:549
msgid "Times of day"
msgstr "一天中的时刻"

#: services/webservice/scheduler_plan.py:550
msgid "Minutes of mission time"
msgstr "任务时间（分钟）"

#: services/webservice/scheduler_plan.py:551
msgid "Minutes of server runtime"
msgstr "服务器运行时间（分钟）"

#: services/webservice/scheduler_plan.py:552
msgid "Minutes with nobody on"
msgstr "无玩家在线（分钟）"

#: services/webservice/scheduler_plan.py:553
msgid "Cron expression"
msgstr "Cron 表达式"

#: services/webservice/scheduler_plan.py:558
msgid "One row per time of day, read in this block's timezone. A row with no time states nothing."
msgstr "每行一个时刻，按此块的时区读取。没有时刻的行不表示任何内容。"

#: services/webservice/scheduler_plan.py:560
msgid "Applied once the mission has run this many minutes."
msgstr "任务运行这么多分钟后执行。"

#: services/webservice/scheduler_plan.py:561
msgid "Applied once the server has run this many minutes."
msgstr "服务器运行这么多分钟后执行。"

#: services/webservice/scheduler_plan.py:562
msgid "Applied after this many minutes with nobody on the server."
msgstr "服务器无人这么多分钟后执行。"

#: services/webservice/scheduler_plan.py:563
msgid "5 to 7 fields. The next three fires are shown under the field."
msgstr "5 到 7 个字段。字段下方显示接下来的三次触发。"

#: services/webservice/scheduler_plan.py:567
msgid "An entry states ONE of these. Choosing another removes the others from the plan, and the save deletes them from the file."
msgstr "一个条目只声明其中之一。选择另一个会把其余的从计划中移除，保存时再从文件中删除。"

#: services/webservice/scheduler_plan.py:569
msgid "This entry states more than one trigger. Only the one shown is kept: the bot reads times of day first, then mission time, then server runtime, then idle time, and cron last — so the others are removed from the plan and deleted from the file on save."
msgstr "此条目声明了多个触发器。只保留显示的那个：机器人先读一天中的时刻，再读任务时间、服务器运行时间、空闲时间，最后是 cron——因此其余的会从计划中移除，并在保存时从文件中删除。"

#: services/webservice/scheduler_plan.py:578
msgid "This entry's trigger is a deprecated key"
msgstr "此条目的触发器是一个已弃用的键"

#: services/webservice/scheduler_plan.py:579
msgid "This key is deprecated and this tab does not write it, so this entry cannot be retriggered here."
msgstr "此键已弃用，本选项卡不会写入它，因此无法在这里重新触发此条目。"

#: services/webservice/scheduler_plan.py:581
msgid "Everything else about this entry stays editable — its method, its conditions and its mission picks — and a save leaves the key exactly as the file states it."
msgstr "此条目的其他部分仍可编辑——方法、条件和任务选择——保存时该键会完全保持文件中的原样。"

#: services/webservice/scheduler_plan.py:616
msgid "The options below follow this choice: a load names its mission, a restart or rotate changes the presets, and stop or shutdown names no mission at all."
msgstr "下面的选项随此选择而定：load 指定任务，restart 或 rotate 更改预设，stop 或 shutdown 完全不涉及任务。"

#: services/webservice/scheduler_plan.py:624
msgid "A load names its mission one of the two ways, never both: the save removes the value the other key carried."
msgstr "load 用两种方式之一指定任务，绝不两种都用：保存时会删除另一个键携带的值。"

#: services/webservice/templates/scheduler_body.html:559
msgid "Remove this time"
msgstr "删除这个时刻"

#: services/webservice/scheduler_plan.py:778
msgid "A time of day"
msgstr "一天中的时刻"

#: services/webservice/templates/scheduler_body.html:591
msgid "Add a time"
msgstr "添加时刻"

#: services/webservice/templates/scheduler_body.html:612
msgid "The hard cap: at that many minutes of mission time the mission restarts even with players on. The bot applies it only while this entry waits until nobody is flying."
msgstr "硬性上限：任务时间达到这么多分钟时，即使有玩家也会重启任务。机器人只在此条目等待无人飞行时应用它。"

#: services/webservice/config_apply.py:105
msgid "Apply now"
msgstr "立即应用"

#: services/webservice/config_apply.py:106
msgid "Apply the change"
msgstr "应用更改"

#: services/webservice/config_apply.py:107
msgid "Apply the change now"
msgstr "立即应用更改"

#: services/webservice/config_apply.py:108
msgid "Not now"
msgstr "暂时不"

#: services/webservice/config_apply.py:109
#: services/webservice/templates/_notice.html:43
msgid "Reload this page"
msgstr "重新加载此页"

#: services/webservice/config_apply.py:111
msgid "Reload the %(plugin)s plugin now?"
msgstr "现在重新加载插件 %(plugin)s？"

#: services/webservice/config_apply.py:113
msgid "The plugin is unloaded and loaded again, and it reads its configuration file as it starts. Nothing restarts and no DCS server goes down."
msgstr "该插件会被卸载并重新加载，启动时读取它的配置文件。不会有任何东西重启，也不会有 DCS 服务器下线。"

#: services/webservice/config_apply.py:115
msgid "Reload the %(plugin)s plugin"
msgstr "重新加载插件 %(plugin)s"

#: services/webservice/config_apply.py:117
msgid "Restart the bot on node %(node)s now?"
msgstr "现在在节点 %(node)s 上重启机器人？"

#: services/webservice/config_apply.py:119
msgid "Every DCS server on %(node)s goes down with it. Nothing starts them again by itself: the launcher on that machine brings the bot back, and the servers with it."
msgstr "%(node)s 上的每个 DCS 服务器都会随之下线。它们不会自己重新启动：那台机器上的启动器会把机器人带回来，服务器也随之回来。"

#: services/webservice/config_apply.py:122
msgid "The bot process ends and the launcher starts it again, so this change is read at boot."
msgstr "机器人进程结束，启动器会重新启动它，因此这项更改在启动时读取。"

#: services/webservice/config_apply.py:123
msgid "Restart the bot on node %(node)s"
msgstr "在节点 %(node)s 上重启机器人"

#: services/webservice/config_apply.py:124
msgid "the master node"
msgstr "主节点"

#: services/webservice/config_apply.py:127
msgid "The change is in the file and takes effect after the %(plugin)s plugin is reloaded."
msgstr "更改已写入文件，重新加载插件 %(plugin)s 后生效。"

#: services/webservice/config_apply.py:129
msgid "The change is in the file and takes effect after a bot restart on %(node)s."
msgstr "更改已写入文件，%(node)s 上重启机器人后生效。"

#: services/webservice/config_apply.py:130
msgid "The change is in the file and takes effect when the next mission is prepared — nothing is reloaded for it."
msgstr "更改已写入文件，在准备下一个任务时生效——为此不会重新加载任何内容。"

#: services/webservice/config_apply.py:134
msgid "Reloading the %(plugin)s plugin — this page reloads once now."
msgstr "正在重新加载插件 %(plugin)s——此页现在会刷新一次。"

#: services/webservice/config_apply.py:136
msgid "Restarting the bot on %(node)s — its DCS servers go down with it. This page reloads once now; if the console does not answer yet, reload it again in a moment."
msgstr "正在重启 %(node)s 上的机器人——它的 DCS 服务器会随之下线。此页现在会刷新一次；如果控制台还没有响应，请稍后再刷新一次。"

#: services/webservice/config_apply.py:140
msgid "Nothing was applied: this confirmation is no longer valid. Save the change again and apply the fresh one."
msgstr "没有应用任何内容：此确认已失效。请重新保存更改，然后应用新的确认。"

#: services/webservice/config_apply.py:142
msgid "Nothing was reloaded or restarted: the bot process cannot be reached from here."
msgstr "没有重新加载或重启任何内容：从这里无法连接到机器人进程。"

#: services/webservice/config_apply.py:145
msgid "Nothing was reloaded: the %(plugin)s plugin is not loaded in this process. Restart the bot to apply the change."
msgstr "没有重新加载任何内容：插件 %(plugin)s 没有在此进程中加载。请重启机器人以应用更改。"

#: services/webservice/config_apply.py:147
msgid "Nothing was restarted: this installation knows no node named %(node)s."
msgstr "没有重启任何内容：此安装中没有名为 %(node)s 的节点。"

#: services/webservice/config_apply.py:149
msgid "Nothing was restarted: a restart of %(node)s is already in flight."
msgstr "没有重启任何内容：%(node)s 的重启已在进行中。"

#: services/webservice/config_apply.py:150
msgid "Nothing was applied: this file is read when a mission is prepared, so it applies at the next launch."
msgstr "没有应用任何内容：此文件在准备任务时读取，因此会在下次启动时生效。"

#: services/webservice/config_apply.py:152
msgid "Nothing was applied: no apply action is defined for this file."
msgstr "没有应用任何内容：此文件未定义任何应用操作。"

#: services/webservice/templates/apply_confirm.html:39
msgid "Target:"
msgstr "目标："

#: services/webservice/config_apply.py:156
